  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "接受別人ê缺陷"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<span id=\"internal-source-marker_0.5030762690585107\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><b id=\"internal-source-marker_0.5030762690585107\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><b id=\"internal-source-marker_0.5030762690585107\" style=\"font-size: medium; white-space: normal;\"></b></span></b></span></span><br />\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display: inline !important; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt; text-indent: 366pt;\">\n<span id=\"internal-source-marker_0.5030762690585107\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><b id=\"internal-source-marker_0.5030762690585107\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><b id=\"internal-source-marker_0.5030762690585107\" style=\"font-size: medium; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">林美麗</span></span></b></span></b></span></span></div>\n<span id=\"internal-source-marker_0.5030762690585107\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><b id=\"internal-source-marker_0.5030762690585107\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><b id=\"internal-source-marker_0.5030762690585107\" style=\"font-size: medium; white-space: normal;\">\n</b></span></b></span></span><br />\n<div>\n<span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><br /></span></span></span></div>\n<div>\n<span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">M̄管天氣按怎，便若緊張ia̍h是天氣轉熱，我ê手就ē流手sio̍h。國校仔ê時，課間活動ài跳土風舞，逐擺若hām同學手牽手，lóng ē看著in hit種棄嫌ê表情，看in一直拭手、pué手，kài-sîng teh phì-siùⁿ流手sio̍h ê我是一个無清氣ê人。</span></span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"></span></span><br />\n<a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></span></div>\n<div>\n<span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">所擺tsîng細漢我就真自卑，一直感覺流手sio̍h是一種破phah，ē hō͘人無好ê印象，所以一直封閉家己，mā無啥mih知己ê朋友，若以tsín. ê醫學智識來看，甚至是接近自閉ê程度--ah，m̄-koh tsit个情形tī升起去國中了後suah有真大ê改變。</span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></span></div>\n<div>\n<span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Hit个時tsūn，guán班有一个查某同學，身軀kap面lóng生白tiō，guán班ê同學lóng驚ē hō͘伊tò͘--著，suah無人beh hām伊做伙sńg，kan-ta我猶原對伊友善。便若有活動，伊上愛giú我ê手，逐擺我lóng想beh kā手勼--轉-來，m̄-koh伊kài-sîng無發覺我ê手ē tâm-tâm、黏黏，猶原kā我la̍k-ân-ân。我叫是伊m̄知影我ē流手sio̍h，有一擺koh特別kā提醒，siáng.知影伊根本就無掛意，到hit tsūn我tsiah體會伊ê用心。</span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></span></div>\n<div>\n<span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">人講「世間無完人」，每一个人免不了ē有一寡仔小缺陷，tsia-ê缺陷其實是bē損害一个人ê人格，mā無必要因為誤解或者是偏見來拒絕別人，咱應當知影「接受別人，mā是對家己好」，因為每一个人lóng m̄是十全十美ê人。</span></span></div>"
  },
